<title>UK: SOCCER-KILMARNOCK REACH SCOTTISH CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KILMARNOCK REACH SCOTTISH CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>EDINBURGH 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kilmarnock reached their first Scottish Cup final for 37 years with a 1-0 win over Dundee United on Tuesday.</p>
<p>After a goalless first match, the replay also remained blank until the 86th minute when Jim McIntyre struck to settle the outcome from close-range.</p>
<p>Kilmarnock's final opponents on May 24 will be either Celtic or Falkirk.</p>
</text>
